## 4. Runbook Library

### Template: Service Degradation

**Symptoms:** p95 latency elevated; error rate rising; alerts firing

**Diagnosis:**

```bash
# Check recent deployments
git log --oneline -10

# Check error logs (last 15 min)
# Replace with your log provider CLI
grep "ERROR" logs/app.log | tail -100

# Check resource saturation
# Replace with your monitoring CLI
```

**Mitigations (in order):**

1. If recent deploy: roll back immediately
2. Restart affected pods/processes (if stateless)
3. Scale horizontally if saturation is root cause
4. Enable circuit-breaker if upstream dependency is failing
5. Escalate to engineering lead if not resolved within 15 min

---
