## 5. Capacity Planning

Review quarterly. Trigger immediate review if any metric crosses 70% of limit.

| Resource | Current baseline | 70% trigger | 100% limit | Action at trigger |
| ---------- | ---------------- | ----------- | ---------- | ----------------------- |
| CPU | — | 56 cores | 80 cores | Add node or right-size |
| Memory | — | 56 GB | 80 GB | Add node or right-size |
| Storage | — | 700 GB | 1 TB | Expand volume |
| DB connections | — | 140 | 200 | Scale pool or add replica |

_Update this table during each quarterly review._
